      <activity id="457fbfb8-dc7b-5f15-bd49-b3b063e5c712" activityNameId="33f8956a-fe6e-5635-8217-e06f693e58bc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gallium, in Bayer liquor from aluminium production, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gallium, in Bayer liquor from aluminium production, at plant
This dataset is designed for accounting for resource depletion in the gallium production. As gallium is assumed to be a by-product of the aluminium production, no upstream burden is allocated to the gallium solved in the bayer liquor. Do not use this dataset for the production of gallium.;
CAS number: 007440-55-3; 
Formula: Ga; 
UUID: 2976ff38-4e54-3e45-9402-069e51f51c7c
This data set describes the simultaneous extraction of gallium together with aluminium in the Bayer process of the aluminium production.
Location: Data from Literature
Technology: dissolution of gallium during the Bayer-Process for aluminium production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2976ff38-4e54-3e45-9402-069e51f51c7c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
